best friends Sonny and Sam hope to find treasure in other people’s trash. But when cleaning out the old Stine house, they open a locked book that frees a supernatural nightmare – Slappy! Now, with the help of Sonny’s sister Sarah, they’re in a race against time to get the sinister dummy and all the creatures he’s brought to life back into the pages before he unleashes total pandemonium!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":649609,\"title\":\"Renfield\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p6yUjhvNGQpFZilKwOKbxQ1eHlo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nHbsOoAESokKFaIPQGGHR0jJiAP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Having grown sick and tired of his centuries as Dracula's lackey, Renfield finds a new lease on life — and maybe even redemption — when he falls for feisty, perennially angry traffic cop Rebecca Quincy.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":463821,\"title\":\"The House with a Clock in Its Walls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qM66Hv4ByAxnilr0jaqCA9uOD4Y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tQvvRReWhrXnj28s4AIp2PblByg.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When ten-year-old Lewis is suddenly orphaned, he is sent to live with his Uncle Jonathan in a creaky (and creepy) old mansion with a mysterious ticking noise that emanates from the walls. Upon discovering that his uncle is a warlock, Lewis begins learning magic, but when he rebelliously resurrects an evil warlock he must find the secret of the house and save the world from destruction.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":667276,\"title\":\"Las leyendas: El origen\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fR49hZdFJ6ZtRS23JW79VYmZgI7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iGOzuXMymytSWdB8w2R04uyDLAU.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a human baby crosses the Eternal Mirror, the portal between the living and the dead opens its path to the beings from the underworld.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23202,\"title\":\"Trick 'r Treat\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w0nmol4g7n6MFfhfphV7GzHHYjB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7rPwe5T63MT9GfOct0be50pYdAL.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Four interwoven stories that occur on Halloween: an everyday high school principal has a secret life as a serial killer; a college virgin might have just met the one guy for her; a group of teenagers pull a mean prank, and a bitter old recluse receives an uninvited guest.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":645519,\"title\":\"PandaMonium\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yMTLlJgfaWFUo2xlFlBd4nCQMI3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9W5x6JJYj52aI4D6oMx27AdW5Hu.jpg\",\"rating\":3.5,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The guys on Level 6 like to work hard, and party harder, that means the best booze, the finest drugs and hottest women money can buy. Unfortunately for them the Strippers they've just hired have come with an unwanted guest.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"TkU3Gg9yAmk\",\"name\":\"You love Buddy, yes you do...\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"yjWnpBRWNeE\",\"name\":\"You can't be brave unless you're scared...\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"acPJ1EUhA5M\",\"name\":\"Buddy can't wait to see you\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}